<title>USA: CCC buys 35,000 tonnes wheat for Tajikistan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 35,000 tonnes wheat for Tajikistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 35,000 tonnes of hard red winter wheat Thursday for donation to Tajikistan.</p>
<p>It bought the wheat from Continental Grain Co at $137.57 per tonne FOB. Shipment was scheduled for July 23 to August 12.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
